Package: videogameinsightsR
Title: Interface to 'Video Game Insights' API for Gaming Market Analytics
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Phillip", "Black",
           email = "pblack@gameeconomistconsulting.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Phillip Black [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Phillip Black <pblack@gameeconomistconsulting.com>
Description: Interface to the 'Video Game Insights' API v4
    <https://app.sensortower.com/vgi/> for video game market analytics.
    Retrieves game metadata, developer and publisher information, player
    statistics (concurrent players, daily and monthly active users), revenue
    and units, reviews, wishlists, followers, price history, player overlap
    and player demographics for games on 'Steam', 'PlayStation' and 'Xbox',
    as tidy tibbles with VGI and Steam identifiers for cross-platform
    comparison.
